			"notes": "- **Added** new config options to explicitly set dimensions for Overworld/Nether/End TG mobs (by default, they can spawn ONLY in 3 those vanilla dimensions)\n- **Added** new config options for ore clusters - now you can explicitly set which exact oredicts you want to see in each type of cluster ore!\n- **Fixed** Fabricator not crafting anything even when it has correct items inside\n- **Fixed** machines sometimes not processing a recipe even if you put right items in it\n- **Implemented** an old lost M4 skin - textures were in the mod files but never actually implemented"
